# Directory spec for the `agent` crate: shipped binary + reusable library + package
# tooling assets. Submodules and asset trees are specified by nearer specs.

Spec: agent

Platform: Rust/Kubernetes

Purpose:
  The `agent` binary run inside Kubernetes Jobs and the developer CLI. It performs the actual
  work a Job is dispatched for: the package OCI lifecycle (build, update, test, validate,
  lint), instance operations (install, delete, backup, restore) for the three instance kinds,
  CRD generation, and box/template/run utilities.

Structure:
  ./src/main.rs: Binary entrypoint and clap `@Commands` dispatch
  ./src/lib.rs: Library root re-exporting the test harness
  ./src/package/: Package lifecycle subcommands, lint, and OCI packaging
  ./src/{system,service,tenant}/: Per-kind instance operations
  ./src/linting/: Static lint of package structure, Handlebars, and Rhai
  ./src/testing/: `agent package test` engine and Rhai regression harness
  ./src/boxes/: box and file-scan operations
  ./src/crdgen.rs: CRD manifest generation
  ./src/run.rs: `agent run` script runner
  ./src/template/: `agent template` render helper
  ./src/version.rs: version subcommand
  ./templates/: Job/package Handlebars templates packaged into the image
  ./scripts/: Rhai scripts packaged into the image
  ./tests/: Rust integration and Rhai regression tests
  ./Dockerfile: Runtime image build (contract in ./Dockerfile.sdd)
  ./parent.toml: Standalone workspace manifest used only by the image build (generated)
  ./providers.tf: OpenTofu provider pins pre-seeded into the image

Owns:
  ./src/main.rs
  ./src/lib.rs
  ./Cargo.toml
  ./parent.toml
  ./providers.tf
  ./templates/**
  ./scripts/**

Must:
  Build the standalone workspace through `./parent.toml` so the image builds without the other
    binaries in the workspace.
  Ship `./templates/` and `./scripts/` into the image under the paths set by `TEMPLATE_DIRECTORY`
    and `SCRIPT_DIRECTORY`.
  Keep the CLI flags and exit codes described in `/docs/cli.md` stable unless the owning
    subcommand spec changes them.

Must not:
  Depend on the `operator` or `server` crates.
  Hand-edit `./parent.toml`; regenerate it with `cargo cmd generate`.

Depends on:
  ./common/common.sdd

Done when:
  Each subcommand submodule has a reviewed same-basename or nested directory spec, and
    `cargo test -p agent` is green.

Tasks:
  [ ] #0 Spec the `./src/package/` and `./src/linting/` submodules.
  [ ] #1 Spec the instance-operation submodules and `./src/testing/` harness.
  [ ] #2 Spec the packaged `./scripts/` Rhai library under its own spec.
